            "review_title": "Review at Viako Garden",
            "review_text": "bj268lovestj\nChengdu, China31 contributions\n0\nFresh, clean, delicious!\nAug 2019 • Family\nViako Garden is a great mix of Vietnamese and Korean food! It has the ground floor and 2 upstairs rooms that can be reserved for group gatherings. The decor completeness the look well! I love all the art on the wall. \nFood:\nVery good quality spring rolls, pho, etc. Very delicious and fresh! Loved the Korean dishes too! Prices level is medium but definitely reasonable. Highly recommend for a date night, for a family, for a group party, for tourist wanting some quality food.\nRead more\nWritten August 17, 2019",
